歡迎的招牌，配料誠意十足，因為添加了高麗菜，這在傳統日式拉麵中較為少見，但也因此為濃郁的豚骨湯頭增添了清甜感，吃起來不易膩口。\n秘製蒜味噌拉麵：\n推薦給喜歡重口味的人，蒜香與味噌融合得恰到話處，湯頭更顯濃厚。\n甘味人生拉麵：\n湯底為非常清甜的醬油底，應該有使用許多蔬果熬煮的，帶有獨特甘甜層次的口味。\n\n喜歡吃肉的朋友也可以勾選「肉花版」，滿滿一圈叉燒肉看了也非常療癒\n此外供應免費加麵一球，一樣可以客製化正常、硬、生麵\n\n整體價位約在220–300元之間，不收服務費，對比現在許多動輒 300 元起跳且份量精緻的拉麵店，這裡的 CP 值極高\n\n最後建議各位到來的客人請把拉麵吃到見底，不要問我為什麼😂",null,[0,30]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,701,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsdmNrNVNOVjlQWjNwclgweGtOMHBQYldZNVpIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x23e5508334092487!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOklvck5SNV9PZ3prX0xkN0pPbWY5ZHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsdmNrNVNOVjlQWjNwclgweGtOMHBQYldZNVpIYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsdmNrNVNOVjlQWjNwclgweGtOMHBQYldZNVpIYxI-